+# Version Numbering Scheme
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use semantic versioning (semver), with version numbers in the major.minor.patch format. The rationale on record is that semver signals compatibility to users: it distinguishes breaking changes from minor updates, so users can make informed decisions when updating.
